{
  "$comment": [
    "Config-justification campaign — proves every RestorationConfiguration field.",
    "Companion: CONFIG_JUSTIFICATION.md (field -> experiment -> target-metric map).",
    "Each ablation experiment pairs the baseline {} against one override row per",
    "lever, on a scenario built to STRESS that lever (read the metric named in the",
    "registry, not global PWSF). Default-ON flags flip OFF (does removing it hurt?);",
    "default-OFF experimental flags flip ON (does adding it help / should it ship?).",
    "Sweep experiments defend the tuning constants. Standalone from eval_full.json."
  ],
  "name": "eval_config_justification",
  "out_root": "experiment/_runs/eval_justification",
  "simulation_duration_s": 30.0,
  "task_timeout_s": 2400.0,
  "failure_delay_s_max": 2.0,
  "write_timeseries": true,
  "timestamp_dir": true,
  "defaults": {
    "runs_per_grid": 15,
    "failure_lambda": 1.5,
    "max_failures": 4
  },
  "experiments": [
    {
      "$comment_block": "L2 holonic / ADMM core. Concentrated-5 on simbench_lv drives a deep one-community deficit so holon redistribution, priority allocation, tier stratification, summary inversion-detection and the change-only cascade all fire. Metric: PWSF + priority-inversion count + churn/abandonment (NOT raw PWSF alone).",
      "name": "just_holonic_core",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 15,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
        {
          "enable_holonic": false
        },
        {
          "enable_dynamic_holon_topology": false
        },
        {
          "enable_priority_holon_allocation": false
        },
        {
          "enable_tier_stratified_holon_admm": false
        },
        {
          "enable_holon_summary": false
        },
        {
          "enable_distributed_failure_notice": false
        },
        {
          "enable_l2_priority_floor": false
        },
        {
          "enable_actuated_ledger_writeback": false
        },
        {
          "enable_change_only_dispatch": false
        },
        {
          "enable_monotonic_floor": true
        },
        {
          "holon_admm_scope": "sector"
        },
        {
          "holon_admm_scope": "holon"
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "clean",
          "failure_type": "concentrated",
          "n_failures": 5,
          "priority_assignment": "skewed",
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.45
        }
      ],
      "target_metrics": [
        "outcomes__priority_weighted_fraction",
        "claims__priority_invariant__passed",
        "diary__abandoned",
        "claims__constraint_compliance__passed",
        "claims__slack_budget_compliance__passed"
      ],
      "population": "compliant"
    },
    {
      "$comment_block": "L1 gossip / sub-community dispatch. Same concentrated-5 deficit. enable_qp_gossip OFF reverts to legacy equal-share; clpu_ramp OFF removes inrush throttling; modularity vs label-propagation changes partitioning. Metric: PWSF, share-stall events, ramp-violation, community-size dispersion.",
      "name": "just_gossip_l1",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 15,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
