    {
      "$comment_block": "L3 cross-sector / CP layer. cp_heavy_dependent + generator failures + slack 0.15: restoration MUST flow through coupling points (the displaced primary gen is gone), the only regime where CP-ADMM, dynamic CP filtering, coalitions and heat->L3 supply have signal. Metric: served on dependent grid, cross-sector recovery, slack compliance.",
