    {
      "$comment_block": "Line-loading / curtailment pipeline. line_stress (load 1.8, ampacity 0.5) forces overload after a branch redirect, the only regime where the line monitor, constraint-aware gossip, multihop forwarding, auction + gating/targeting, reassert, branch-downstream relief and the reverse-priority waterfall all fire. Metric: line-loading violation integral, shed efficiency, priority-inversion under relief.",
      "name": "just_line_curtail",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 15,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
        {
          "enable_line_loading_constraint": false
        },
        {
          "enable_constraint_aware_gossip": false
        },
        {
          "enable_multihop_constraint": false
        },
        {
          "enable_curtailment_auction": false
        },
        {
          "enable_line_relief_reassert": true
        },
        {
          "enable_branch_downstream_relief": false
        },
        {
          "enable_line_relief_waterfall": false
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "line_stress",
          "load_scale": 1.8,
          "ampacity_scale": 0.5,
          "max_failures": 3,
          "priority_assignment": "skewed",
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.45
        }
      ],
      "target_metrics": [
        "claims__constraint_compliance__detail__by_variable__line_load__n_violations",
        "outcomes__constraint_violation_integral__electricity",
        "claims__priority_invariant__passed",
        "outcomes__priority_weighted_fraction",
        "claims__constraint_compliance__passed",
        "claims__slack_budget_compliance__passed"
      ],
      "population": "all"
    },
    {
      "$comment_block": "Voltage support. pv_peak on simbench_lv_small (the SMALL grid actually over-volts; the large grid never does) pushes vm_pu past the 1.03 deadband. Tests droop, VVW, the experimental auction-coordination hand-off + its feeder gate, the curtail-ramp interlock, recompute-on-failure and the end-of-sim settle tail. Metric: voltage-violation integral, over-voltage clear rate, PV curtailment, limit-cycle count.",
      "name": "just_voltage",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv_small"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 15,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {},
